"entity": {
"name": "Essity AB",
"description": "Essity AB engages in the development, production, and marketing of personal care products. It operates through the following segments: Health & Medical, Consumer Goods, Professional Hygiene, and Other Operations. The Personal Care segment offers incontinence products, wound care, compression therapy, orthopedics, skincare products and digital products with sensor technology. The Consumer Tissue segment consists of incontinence products, pads, diapers, wet wipes, skin cream, intimate soaps, leakproof apparel, menstrual cups, toilet paper, household towels, handkerchiefs, facial tissues and napkins. The Professional Hygiene segment comprises of complete hygiene solutions, including toilet paper, paper hand towels, napkins, hand soap, hand lotion, hand sanitizers, dispensers, cleaning and wiping products, internet of things sensor technology, and service and maintenance. The Other Operations segment refers to the group-wide functions. The company was founded in 1929 and is headquartered in Stockholm, Sweden.",
"rbics_econ": "Consumer Non-Cyclicals",
"rbics_sector": "Household Products",
